            <ArticleTitle>Stroke complicating adenosine perfusion imaging.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>659-60</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pharmacologic stress-testing using adenosine is increasing in popularity. Side-effects have been limited to the infusion time and a brief recovery period. Long-lasting complications may, however, result rarely.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
